Z||000009||wkayl||02-12-2000||11:48 PM||||My wife had to drive my GT last week just after it snowed. My son hadn't gotten his GT yet so in the snow I thought it would be better if he drove the 4x4.  Wife said she slid a little sideways on the 1st corner and had a little respect for the snappy V6 after that. She is used to the full size ext cab.||||reg||1
Z||000010||Gokart||02-13-2000||06:03 AM||||I HATE WINTER! If UPS did transfers I'd be somewhere down south tomorrow! With 10 years I feel sort of "TRAPPED". well theres always retirement! I can't wait till I can turn my outside water back on (off so pipes won't freeze) so I won't have to rely on the car wash downtown. They told me the wash is recycled water but the rinse is fresh. Then why does my GT have little white spots (salt) all over it when I get it home after drying!! LIERS!||||reg||8
Z||000011||Raydar||02-13-2000||04:41 PM||||It was about 68 and sunny in Atlanta, yesterday.<BR>On the other hand, I'd much rather have snow (like up North), than an ice storm (like we had here, several weeks ago). At least snow doesn't take down the trees and power lines.  <p>[This message has been edited by Raydar (edited 02-13-2000).]||||reg||6
Z||000012||Standard||02-14-2000||03:28 AM||||I hate winter!!! i hate it i hate it i hate it i hate it!!  And to make matters worse, my GT that I bought a week ago froze solid.. knew I should of replaced the anti-freeze.. it's thawed out in the garage now.  <P>Wide tires (and more torque) slide around quite a bit in the snow.  Took a while to get used to my GT.. going from a 4 cyl with 185/80r13's to the GT with 195/60hr15's on the front and 205/60hr15 on the back.  A little squirrley at times.. 2nd gear starts help in the snow, won't break the tires loose quite so quickly.  oh yeah, did I mention <B>i hate snow!!! cold too!!</B>||||reg||1
Z||000015||SpeedPhreak||02-14-2000||12:34 PM||||BITE YOUR TOUNGE!!!!<P>i love the winter...snow boarding...snow boarding...& SNOW BOARDING!<P>the only downside...no motorcycles.<P>so far this winter has been very mild here in colorado springs.  ive ridden my bike several times since the 1st snow & went boarding for the first time this season on sat the 12th.<P>although im kind of anxious for this summer...let it snow let it snow let it snow!||||reg||11
